{
  "info": {
    "name": "Trip Booking Platform API",
    "description": "Mini travel-booking platform \u2014 a Trip = one flight seat + one hotel room.\n\nNO AUTHENTICATION: every endpoint is open. A trip's owner is the {{userId}} sent in the request body.\n{{userId}} defaults to 2 (the seeded 'demo' account) \u2014 check the booking-service startup log for the\nactual seeded ids.\n\nSETUP: MySQL :3306, Kafka :9092, then from the repo root:\n  ./mvnw -pl payment-service spring-boot:run   (:8081)\n  ./mvnw -pl booking-service spring-boot:run   (:8080)\n\nBooking is ASYNC. 'Book trip' returns 202 PENDING and publishes a Kafka event; the payment\nservice charges and replies, and booking settles the trip to CONFIRMED (or CANCELLED if declined).\nPoll 'Get trip by id' after booking. To see compensation, run booking with --booking.trip-price=100000\n(payment declines >= 100000) and watch the trip go CANCELLED with the seat + room released.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8090"
    },
    {
      "key": "flightId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "seatId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "hotelId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "roomId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tripId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "paymentUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081"
    },
    {
      "key": "paymentId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "seatId2",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "roomId2",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "gatewayUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8090"
    },
    {
      "key": "zipkinUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:9411"
    },
    {
      "key": "directBookingUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "2"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Flights",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create flight",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('flightId', json.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('seatId', json.seats[0].id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('seatId2', json.seats[1].id);   // spare seat for the manual scenarios",
                  "pm.test('has generated seats', () => pm.expect(json.seats.length).to.be.above(1));",
                  "console.log('flightId=' + json.id + '  seatId=' + json.seats[0].id + '  seatId2=' + json.seats[1].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"flightNumber\": \"AI-202\",\n  \"origin\": \"BLR\",\n  \"destination\": \"DXB\",\n  \"departureTime\": \"2030-01-15T09:30:00\",\n  \"seatCount\": 6\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/flights",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "flights"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List flights",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/flights",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "flights"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get flight by id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/flights/{{flightId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "flights",
                "{{flightId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get flight seats",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/flights/{{flightId}}/seats",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "flights",
                "{{flightId}}",
                "seats"
              ]
            }
